# Phase 50 α: the eval suite's generators, rubrics and answer keys (evals/) and the
# design note that describes the planted truths are never shipped to agents or cloud
# workers. `git archive` (the cloud launch tarball) honours export-ignore, and
# cloud/run_cluster.py code_tarball refuses a tarball that still holds any of them
# (scripts/lib/eval_paths.py). A question's input data live in data/evals/<q>/ and ship.
/evals/** export-ignore
/docs/design/eval-suite.md export-ignore
# The launch tarball carries its commit (scripts/lib/pipeline_id.py code_commit): git archive
# fills in the placeholder, so a run on a worker with no .git still records what code it ran.
/scripts/lib/code_commit.txt export-subst
